# Validation Steps

The following command was executed on the Windows 11 endpoint:

```cmd
rundll32.exe shell32.dll,Control_RunDLL
```

This launches the Windows Control Panel and generates a Sysmon Process Creation event.

The resulting event was successfully forwarded to Splunk using the Splunk Universal Forwarder.

